{
  "id": "https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/contacto-tipo/contacto-deposicional",
  "type": "Concept",
  "prefLabel": {
    "es": "contacto deposicional",
    "en": "depositional contact"
  },
  "definition": {
    "es": "Contacto litogenético que delimita una roca sedimentaria o volcánica depositada sobre (o contra) otro cuerpo rocoso. La relación entre las rocas subyacentes y las suprayacentes se desconoce o no se especifica.",
    "en": "Lithogenetic contact at which a sedimentary or volcanic rock has been deposited on (or against) another rock body. The relationship between the older underlying rocks and younger overlying rocks is unknown or not specfied."
  },
